```
and
```php
$conditionFilters[] = 'id IN (SELECT cid FROM assets_metadata WHERE `name` = ' . $db->quote($filterField) . ...
```

While the second usage quotes it as a string value, the first usage directly concatenates it into SQL without any quoting.

